  "description": "Dear Team,\n\nI\u2019m pleased to share the latest performance snapshot for our four\u2011player roster. Over the past sessions our overall rating has moved from an initial 1500 up through 1520, then 1535, and most recently 1550. The players are Alice (ID\u202f1, Tenhou\u202fabcdef01), Bob (ID\u202f2, Tenhou\u202f01234567), Charlie (ID\u202f3, Tenhou\u202f89abcdef) and Diana (ID\u202f4, Tenhou\u202ffedcba98).\n\nIn the most recent games, Game\u202f1001 saw Alice lead with a score of 25\u202f000, gaining a +12.5 rating delta and taking first place; Bob followed with 24\u202f000 points, \u20135.0 rating change and second place; Charlie posted 23\u202f000 points, \u20133.5 rating change for third; Diana ended with 22\u202f000 points, \u20134.0 rating change in fourth. In Game\u202f1002 the order shifted: Bob claimed first with 25\u202f000 points and a +15.3 rating delta, Alice was second with 24\u202f000 points and +8.0, Diana placed third with 23\u202f000 points and \u201312.8, and Charlie finished fourth with 22\u202f000 points and \u20136.7. Across all play we have accumulated 20 first\u2011place finishes, 15 second\u2011place, 10 third\u2011place and 5 fourth\u2011place results, totalling 50 games and 200 rounds.\n\nOur win\u2011type breakdown records 30\u202fron wins, 25\u202ftsumo wins, 5\u202fchombo penalties, 12 feed events, 8 tsumofeed occurrences, and 2 open\u2011hand finishes. Hand\u2011value frequencies are noteworthy: a value of \u201330 appeared \u20132 times, \u20132 showed up 15 times, neutral 0 occurred 30 times, +2 appeared 10 times, and a high of +30 was seen 5 times. Yaku occurrences are as follows: Yaku\u202f1 \u2013 40 times, Yaku\u202f2 \u2013 30, Yaku\u202f3 \u2013 20, and Yaku\u202f5 \u2013 10. Finally, Riichi statistics indicate 22 wins on Riichi, 18 losses while on Riichi, and 7 feeds that happened under Riichi.",
